@startuml umd_device_lifecycle
' Device lifecycle (Section 8.4). Transitions T1..T8 are described in the table under the diagram.
' Explicit arrow directions keep the main flow top to bottom; the recovery loop T7 points up so it does not reorder the ranks.
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] -down-> Discovered : T1
Discovered -down-> Constructed : T2
Constructed -down-> Initialized : T3
Constructed -left-> Failed : T4
Initialized -down-> Operational : T5
Operational -right-> Faulted : T6
Faulted -up-> Constructed : T7
Operational -down-> Closed : T8
Failed -down-> [*]
Closed -down-> [*]

Operational : read / write, firmware commands, DMA
@enduml
